{"id":663,"name":"talonflame","speciesId":663,"dex":663,"form":"normal","generation":6,"types":["fire","flying"],"stats":{"hp":78,"attack":81,"defense":71,"special-attack":74,"special-defense":69,"speed":126},"abilities":[{"name":"flame-body","hidden":false},{"name":"gale-wings","hidden":true}],"height":12,"weight":245,"baseExp":175,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/663.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/663.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/663.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/663.ogg","genus":"Scorching Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"x","text":"In the fever of an exciting battle, it showers embers from the gaps between its feathers and takes to the air."},{"version":"y","text":"When attacking prey, it can reach speeds of up to 310 mph. It finishes its prey off with a colossal kick."},{"version":"sun","text":"Its favorite foods are Wingull and Pikipek. It attacks with a powerful kick and grasps them firmly in its talons."},{"version":"moon","text":"It zooms directly at its prey at flight speeds of close to 310 mph, while fiery embers scatter from gaps in its feathers."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its tough wings don’t allow fire to pass through them. A long time ago, firefighters’ outfits were made from Talonflame wings."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Bird Pokémon make up most of its diet. It approaches at high speeds and smacks them down to the ground with its powerful kick."},{"version":"sword","text":"Talonflame mainly preys upon other bird Pokémon. To intimidate opponents, it sends embers spewing from gaps between its feathers."},{"version":"shield","text":"Talonflame dives toward prey at speeds of up to 310 mph and assaults them with powerful kicks, giving the prey no chance to escape."}]